<urn:sha256:004c901ddaa89d27e096713ac5f19ea049a7a2b8a3dd7f6d263521253bfbf5b8> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:rdf-1-2-turtle-and-trig> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:004c901ddaa89d27e096713ac5f19ea049a7a2b8a3dd7f6d263521253bfbf5b8> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "ADR 0030's recovery rule stands with its depth counted over the RDF 1.2 brackets << >>, <<( )>> and {| |} as well as [ ], ( ) and { }" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:007cb22adb247e5f0cbe2262e4e99e103f02aa8dd7ed7412e844b9c6d3f3533e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
