<urn:sha256:007cb22adb247e5f0cbe2262e4e99e103f02aa8dd7ed7412e844b9c6d3f3533e> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/XsdTypesOutOfScope> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:007cb22adb247e5f0cbe2262e4e99e103f02aa8dd7ed7412e844b9c6d3f3533e> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:varve-xsd-scope-and-precision> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:007cb22adb247e5f0cbe2262e4e99e103f02aa8dd7ed7412e844b9c6d3f3533e> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "hexBinary, base64Binary, anyURI, QName, NOTATION and the types derived from xsd:string are out of scope and compare by lexical form" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:00a513db50d1a8c30edf6563f70f93c6c7f3e4bd0f43d96ecdc9095711c1a8aa> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
