<urn:sha256:00a513db50d1a8c30edf6563f70f93c6c7f3e4bd0f43d96ecdc9095711c1a8aa> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/DefaultServiceHandlerRefuses> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:00a513db50d1a8c30edf6563f70f93c6c7f3e4bd0f43d96ecdc9095711c1a8aa> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:service-through-a-handler-the-default-refuses> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:00a513db50d1a8c30edf6563f70f93c6c7f3e4bd0f43d96ecdc9095711c1a8aa> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The default service handler refuses every endpoint, so the default configuration opens no connection" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:00c18c8608f549fb80a81e91b44e5c5323ec7ed0b21cf6d3c4985c4c74d2ac6c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
