<urn:sha256:00c18c8608f549fb80a81e91b44e5c5323ec7ed0b21cf6d3c4985c4c74d2ac6c> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:extents-and-the-projection-catalog> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:00c18c8608f549fb80a81e91b44e5c5323ec7ed0b21cf6d3c4985c4c74d2ac6c> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A derived format 3 directory opens as it is; its full checkpoints serve until dropped, and the first checkpoint written under format 4 starts the chain of sets" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
