<urn:sha256:072e2bc4d5e6f1f701968954c595fd1bde3472a06214166485ec230abead5337> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The hot-path allow-list admits ImmutableArray of T only by its indexer's getter, Length, IsEmpty, IsDefault, IsDefaultOrEmpty, AsSpan, AsMemory and its struct GetEnumerator, and CancellationToken only by IsCancellationRequested, CanBeCanceled and ThrowIfCancellationRequested, none of which allocates; this replaces their admission by type in AllowListAddsNonAllocatingValueTypes, whose interim clause ends with it" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
