<urn:sha256:0d62e761417c1679d6c2aeaced20bbbdf70a8b379c955e225a66b35468e65909> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:varve-delta-and-the-read-forever-rule> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:0d62e761417c1679d6c2aeaced20bbbdf70a8b379c955e225a66b35468e65909> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "DeltaFormat.Current is 1; a version-1 document is read by every later release and its meaning never changes; a change a version-1 reader would misread is version 2" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:0d8e8ec49a36f19c4e27fcd976164c8c1e911bfea1ef123cbad3cf7415a33ae1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
