<urn:sha256:0d8e8ec49a36f19c4e27fcd976164c8c1e911bfea1ef123cbad3cf7415a33ae1> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Format version 1 has a write window of 4 MiB that no writer exceeds with two or more commits in one flush; a break followed by later records only within it is a torn tail, an abandoned segment is read up to its trailer's head, and a later record further on is damage" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:0e5f35752f289e9703726f80859887deddf7a39ddd2aa54087832cd6d7bfad5a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:0e5f35752f289e9703726f80859887deddf7a39ddd2aa54087832cd6d7bfad5a> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0119" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:0e5f35752f289e9703726f80859887deddf7a39ddd2aa54087832cd6d7bfad5a> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/CatalogueAndImmutabilityTested> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
