<urn:sha256:0e5f35752f289e9703726f80859887deddf7a39ddd2aa54087832cd6d7bfad5a> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A test enumerates every problem the server can emit and asserts it is in the catalogue with exactly its declared members and its page; a property asserts two as-of reads at one closed position return byte-identical bodies and validators" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:0ee7fdaf585b56a634f6f8def676f22c7b84d857e74ad3325dfc927a673ac3ab> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
