<urn:sha256:0ee7fdaf585b56a634f6f8def676f22c7b84d857e74ad3325dfc927a673ac3ab> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The event catalogue graphs are system graphs governed by their source graphs, the first system graphs with a derived grant; varve:setup keeps point 5 as written" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:0efe38a789c84883294d2fd0f8128c4c28f5f7b168d7b7731ed0d5fdae206538> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
