<urn:sha256:0efe38a789c84883294d2fd0f8128c4c28f5f7b168d7b7731ed0d5fdae206538> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A pinned read lives for one query execution, from before evaluation until the last result is consumed or the consumer stops, and is never cached or shared" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
