<urn:sha256:103830f7ed8e7eec9c95c4ebaa742ba0507c1e4060cfb4ae88fddc00a4038035> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Building a run from a commit's delta allocates the run's six key arrays and the array that holds them, because those arrays are the run, kept as long as the index version that holds it; the loop over the quads allocates nothing" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:10422667c0a6f3b2a63a46f2f8823c3fabd4477d12ea59b55ad51b5aec968039> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
