<urn:sha256:10422667c0a6f3b2a63a46f2f8823c3fabd4477d12ea59b55ad51b5aec968039> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "An id's class is its top two bits, counters start at 1 so id 0 is the default graph, and an inline id carries a datatype tag in bits 61 to 56 and a 56-bit payload, frozen as the format's id layout" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:10429ac1e776eaf68806b161442f5b2d25269ab7217c08516a4bdd7fb2ad352a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
