<urn:sha256:10429ac1e776eaf68806b161442f5b2d25269ab7217c08516a4bdd7fb2ad352a> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "IQuadSource answers a triple term's component handles through TryGetTripleTermComponents; the default answers through TryExternalise and TryInternalise, which is the path a consumer took before, and a source whose dictionary holds composite entries answers from the entry, so a blank node inside a triple term keeps the identity ADR 0044 gives it" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:105ddecace9acca7701988985e1b9ee4402737e67930d9fd3b595148acbbf3a5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
