<urn:sha256:105ddecace9acca7701988985e1b9ee4402737e67930d9fd3b595148acbbf3a5> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The product sets no heap hard limit; in a container the runtime bounds the heap at its share of the cgroup limit, and the 128 MB DOTNET_GCHeapHardLimit stays a benchmark-harness setting" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:108dddfcebd855498fc25156f1deab679cc4f5b347c168ac8c4d1a829ee7ac05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
