<urn:sha256:108dddfcebd855498fc25156f1deab679cc4f5b347c168ac8c4d1a829ee7ac05> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A FROM or FROM NAMED naming an unreadable graph names an empty graph, never an error, so no error text reveals a graph's existence" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:10957a42b94b533f0dd72ef70882f08364431750b53dea26e609f38cce0ce4a9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
