<urn:sha256:10957a42b94b533f0dd72ef70882f08364431750b53dea26e609f38cce0ce4a9> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The processor's name table, tree and arenas are kept per thread and reset per document, as ArrayPool keeps its buffers, so that a steady state of documents allocates only what grows; a caller never sees the instance" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:109aa7c9e1792f315d2adbeba1b12448e449e07c2c7cdf07b00e60134b320d46> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
