<urn:sha256:330a60adff2dc98e1a7e1a381d495ca2939ea2b66add875bf285f4f3bae70698> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The Turtle and TriG reader accepts RDF 1.2 as one grammar that is RDF 1.1's superset: reified triples, triple terms, annotations, reifiers, the version directive and LANG_DIR, gated by the rdf12 rdf-turtle and rdf-trig suites" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:330f5f08b651c0652aaf82674724c2f92c26e198b82966a706ee78631a0ccd5d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
