<urn:sha256:330f5f08b651c0652aaf82674724c2f92c26e198b82966a706ee78631a0ccd5d> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A quad source answers a match with IQuadCursor, a forward-only walk with no reset that the caller disposes, not IEnumerator, so a source may hold a lock, a pinned segment or a snapshot for the cursor's lifetime" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:334f9242ee9903d42dc83cc9d980290204fe844a1f7ef63634ddfe9c4f4abf9e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
