<urn:sha256:54a449dd887b5f8338fa0860d8484aef2bba92f09ba4e9427f51469a5169bee5> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/SettingsAreDesiredState> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:54a449dd887b5f8338fa0860d8484aef2bba92f09ba4e9427f51469a5169bee5> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:client-side-setup-and-system-graphs> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:54a449dd887b5f8338fa0860d8484aef2bba92f09ba4e9427f51469a5169bee5> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A setup's settings are desired state, last writer wins: each declared key is compared and, when one differs, the declared keys alone are merged in under If-Match; a manual change to a declared key is overwritten on the next apply, and an undeclared key is never touched" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:54c591bd330a67c5989f19163255936545e30dce5c5393f030cac3d4b8dc5d3c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:54c591bd330a67c5989f19163255936545e30dce5c5393f030cac3d4b8dc5d3c> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0016" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:54c591bd330a67c5989f19163255936545e30dce5c5393f030cac3d4b8dc5d3c> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/DefaultProjectionSynchronous> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:54c591bd330a67c5989f19163255936545e30dce5c5393f030cac3d4b8dc5d3c> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:projection-contract-and-subscriptions> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:54c591bd330a67c5989f19163255936545e30dce5c5393f030cac3d4b8dc5d3c> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The default quad projection is updated before Committed(P) returns, so a pin taken afterwards observes P, and every other projection lags" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:54e11eb2eea52436831b810543bb613befca1f6a3fb5ab06f95950e64107dd14> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
