<urn:sha256:54e11eb2eea52436831b810543bb613befca1f6a3fb5ab06f95950e64107dd14> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A register entry's Scope is enforced by eng/dependency-register.cs over every project, with a failing and a passing fixture run by register-fixture" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:554d40d13e2d68cacf391a32daa8b2589647cb443d67ede4cec793a340fe3a15> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
