<urn:sha256:554d40d13e2d68cacf391a32daa8b2589647cb443d67ede4cec793a340fe3a15> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/NewestEntriesInMemory> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:554d40d13e2d68cacf391a32daa8b2589647cb443d67ede4cec793a340fe3a15> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:the-commit-index-is-derived-and-paged> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:554d40d13e2d68cacf391a32daa8b2589647cb443d67ede4cec793a340fe3a15> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The commit index holds the newest DatasetOptions.CommitCache entries in memory, 4,096 by default, and maintenance writes the oldest half out when twice that is held and merges the newest two blobs while the newer is as large as the older" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:55969d8edb2d65ad85b218b80eb4da7b32910ef1eb2b9ddbd2b94d80e60429f8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
