<urn:sha256:559a559d102328a06ab251d5529580b7668e3768079798cd22ac9b6c7dff311f> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Pin() returns a quad source over the readable head at the moment of the call, stable until released: an engine snapshot, not time travel" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
