<urn:sha256:55d8a4024210b2a4116338085cfe2a5e5b319544cb6f2deba7cdb0b5fcce65da> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
