<urn:sha256:578d93a4ea20f3eb9916c33cd8fb180fcb15dac84d638d962f70cfe85d0696bc> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A dictionary lookup by id reads an entry's offsets and bytes, and a lookup by term searches a hash index sorted by a 64-bit hash of the term's key by interpolation, both through the synchronous blob read of the runs the reader holds" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:587f55d8b34f0e5afc374329b2f797244a98e69dda9936dbd779c0e91e6c4337> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
