<urn:sha256:587f55d8b34f0e5afc374329b2f797244a98e69dda9936dbd779c0e91e6c4337> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Where synchronous access handles do not exist the dataset is kept in IndexedDB, chunks and blobs committed by strict transactions, and an open blob is read whole into memory so that its reads are synchronous" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
