<urn:sha256:5e48bada5484f5183c70848de9573b1a5037468da6e891d9c29fca729557f192> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The decision is about delivering commits; the dataset may own maintenance on derived data under an explicit option, off the sequencer and never blocking a commit, off by default in a browser until 6b" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
