<urn:sha256:5e774f36607ffa9ff66e0cbe5e90eb7fc22cc5460a5f3fa76d7aed0b49000abc> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Opening after a crash during or just after a bulk load holds at most a bound of any one commit's body, verifying a larger one as it passes, and adopts a delta run that continues the loaded index rather than replaying the load from the log" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
