<urn:sha256:71922549535e70cc86825eb4758d2b8ac849f432f78843eb995b81bdfbd960af> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
