<urn:sha256:71db65ce685ceedda18f265fc24d81dc8db13e4fac51c2909c265d450d3d85b3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
