<urn:sha256:720ddeebb55e17c2cd41e79170ad340804f81e3cbecafa677dd148c06237c403> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "An event is a CloudEvents 1.0 structured JSON event in RFC 8785 canonical form, id the position and the node's IRI, sequence the padded position and ordinal, time the commit's timestamp, dataschema the revision in force" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:72220fd946e2b6fa1f31f145df5138f0170edf246bc0ef63ec0b12c2ab7dc48f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
