<urn:sha256:9309ffe77f374328bd87a5b854db2435538195fcfa8b645c629097d2e7b7b908> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A caller reads a catalogue graph exactly when it reads its source graph and writes it exactly when it writes the source graph, through GraphScope's governing-graph seam composed in IAccessScopes" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
