<urn:sha256:977807e89bad7d57695ce469560f8c9c34331901741a17fb2c2ac74014375464> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The service description's own terms are under https://w3id.org/varve/ns#" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:979296dc255f347cff73e84ff11a332071d07957b07f0b29801ba36040d19e0f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:979296dc255f347cff73e84ff11a332071d07957b07f0b29801ba36040d19e0f> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0079" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:979296dc255f347cff73e84ff11a332071d07957b07f0b29801ba36040d19e0f> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/DictionaryIsDerivedInRuns> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:979296dc255f347cff73e84ff11a332071d07957b07f0b29801ba36040d19e0f> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:the-term-dictionary-on-disk> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:979296dc255f347cff73e84ff11a332071d07957b07f0b29801ba36040d19e0f> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The term dictionary is derived state carried by the default projection's runs: each run holds the entries of the canonical ids its commits allocated, a checkpoint those of every id up to its position, merged and persisted with the runs, so opening a dataset loads no dictionary" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:97a4d4bc3bd80543110602d355d0354197bf7745514f2f2e6daaf7a20a040987> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:97a4d4bc3bd80543110602d355d0354197bf7745514f2f2e6daaf7a20a040987> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0140" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:97a4d4bc3bd80543110602d355d0354197bf7745514f2f2e6daaf7a20a040987> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/NoWallClockFreshness> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
