<urn:sha256:97bce203efe22d9ac08f1a27a2a44d5fff55175980afbcc9247a4ca09cc11976> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A JSON number becomes xsd:integer where it has no fraction and no exponent and is below 1e21, and xsd:double otherwise, each in the XSD canonical form Varve.Xsd formats; a value with @type xsd:double or xsd:integer is coerced likewise" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:97dc8ad51da85f5e0f5a9db5ccc45454dee68e3615077457e4ca3e83a71887df> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
