<urn:sha256:97dc8ad51da85f5e0f5a9db5ccc45454dee68e3615077457e4ca3e83a71887df> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/DurationOrders> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:97dc8ad51da85f5e0f5a9db5ccc45454dee68e3615077457e4ca3e83a71887df> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:varve-xsd-scope-and-precision> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:97dc8ad51da85f5e0f5a9db5ccc45454dee68e3615077457e4ca3e83a71887df> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Durations compare by the four-reference-dateTime order, partial for xsd:duration and total for the two derived types" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:98b659d97d8cd94b212caac45e002074f8920e65a1d4139cf630d222046efd49> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:98b659d97d8cd94b212caac45e002074f8920e65a1d4139cf630d222046efd49> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0128" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:98b659d97d8cd94b212caac45e002074f8920e65a1d4139cf630d222046efd49> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/DeltaIsLayerThree> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:98b659d97d8cd94b212caac45e002074f8920e65a1d4139cf630d222046efd49> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:varve-delta-and-the-read-forever-rule> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:98b659d97d8cd94b212caac45e002074f8920e65a1d4139cf630d222046efd49> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Varve.Delta is layer 3 by dependency, referencing Varve.Rdf and Varve.Turtle, whose N-Quads term parser and writer it uses" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:992200c1df43072dd9d10832f55ae47298b05dc427886b63eada1898ed77e550> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
