<urn:sha256:992200c1df43072dd9d10832f55ae47298b05dc427886b63eada1898ed77e550> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/WritesQueueInTheSequencer> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:992200c1df43072dd9d10832f55ae47298b05dc427886b63eada1898ed77e550> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:resource-governance> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:992200c1df43072dd9d10832f55ae47298b05dc427886b63eada1898ed77e550> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A write is not queued by the read limiter; it waits in the sequencer's queue and is written in a bounded batch" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:99441e747fdb42b585f5655a2df3910a1e73a80b51e3797e07a3de965f5514b3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
