<urn:sha256:99441e747fdb42b585f5655a2df3910a1e73a80b51e3797e07a3de965f5514b3> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "DatasetView.Stage() returns a StagingView that reads what the view reads and gives provisional handles, interned by value, for terms it does not hold" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:996d09ff56bb73e8e46b987db55937650b4c31f74a2403a6fd119d7fc66862f7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
