<urn:sha256:996d09ff56bb73e8e46b987db55937650b4c31f74a2403a6fd119d7fc66862f7> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "IFollowCheckpoint has LoadAsync and SaveAsync and the caller implements it; FileFollowCheckpoint replaces its file atomically" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:99dc404dbb57c6565f8e61faa76813a7ad4201505d86e48932c45f76326a247d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
