<urn:sha256:99e86c0f9dac7bb2defde30b97198ec9dbcb2c0a4b5f5f64d73861f1107a85cc> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The storage contract's segment ids, offsets and lengths are SegmentId, ByteOffset and ByteCount" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:99fa9cc494259c8ec3d6b3d273c8b3e547bdbea59165e77606f150e7d4877d80> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
