<urn:sha256:99fa9cc494259c8ec3d6b3d273c8b3e547bdbea59165e77606f150e7d4877d80> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Every commit header carries prev, the hash of the previous commit's header, with a fixed value at position 1" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:9a2470d7610166fa5f284fcea705e4a853a0d15b01a70df06b3ffad6820ed149> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
