<urn:sha256:9a2470d7610166fa5f284fcea705e4a853a0d15b01a70df06b3ffad6820ed149> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A derived blob is read synchronously through IReadableBlob's Length and Read, and runs and checkpoints are scanned through it by one scan code on every backend" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:9a2a56d0e5b9fb0f1b330b44920097218cef79ba7d3f62f2a0b7cef7df0d0eac> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
