<urn:sha256:9a736d6c48e32140c8bcd33837aee2e4326a918ad705ac17661e80bda78897e8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
