<urn:sha256:aae0ed0e2ecee08118c6f8e231492fe2089b496a490fe040fee0f991029bea69> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "An open log segment is a sequence of write-once chunk objects named log/NNNNNNNN.chunks/CCCCCCCC, one per flush that has bytes, each created by create-if-absent, so group commit pays exactly one create per batch" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:aae52e159e0f8c5b062ad99f2a04869a4225b1b8c7f6b14cf226a98c3bcfbacd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
