<urn:sha256:aae52e159e0f8c5b062ad99f2a04869a4225b1b8c7f6b14cf226a98c3bcfbacd> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Every open of the object-storage backend for write probes under a random key of the reserved probe/ that a second create-if-absent and a replace against a stale version are both refused, and refuses to open a store where either succeeds; a follower, which never writes the log, does not probe" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:aaf8b30d4ca032ccf696df928beb19aac71104dd85deac0d3bfab1f7b287b19a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
