<urn:sha256:aaf8b30d4ca032ccf696df928beb19aac71104dd85deac0d3bfab1f7b287b19a> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The fence is the slot after the last existing one in log order, the first slot of the next segment after a seal, so the only new create a superseded writer can make is the fence slot, which exists" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
