<urn:sha256:ab3f9ddb032f46c48475b290c11202e86d79734f0ba7a88e7f759b7f46799c12> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A descriptor's basis resolves at the commit under release: each milestone issue it names closed by a trailer in the range, exactly the ADRs first shipped and each Accepted, and the storage format equal to Varve.Store's" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:ab406e75f036c2816ea43be4d6c63dca6981c43731427e8abcccfb1baeae2ba3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
