<urn:sha256:b13ef5d52d945f1ef0ca6a7750de32ea15f759c0115ac9bcc492b0e860ffbdac> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
