<urn:sha256:b13ef5d52d945f1ef0ca6a7750de32ea15f759c0115ac9bcc492b0e860ffbdac> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The RDF/XML writer splits each distinct predicate into namespace, local name and prefix once and caches the strings by the predicate's bytes, so that no string is made per triple" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b24f48e052954463e95ca63402889954886b868debc930ead052338893a25bda> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
