<urn:sha256:b24f48e052954463e95ca63402889954886b868debc930ead052338893a25bda> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:varve-delta-and-the-read-forever-rule> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b24f48e052954463e95ca63402889954886b868debc930ead052338893a25bda> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Varve.Delta owns the delta format's reader, writer, record model and event framing, over Varve.Rdf types and its own position, timestamp and commit-kind types" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b2ad22e4aeadf954cc7b44930db42ffbf745c5b51e3ba44ee70fdb2569874d2d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
