<urn:sha256:b2ad22e4aeadf954cc7b44930db42ffbf745c5b51e3ba44ee70fdb2569874d2d> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "OIDC bearer tokens are the only accepted credential, and no later decision adds API keys or another secret scheme" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b2c2e8ac64ca781430d95ad522ccab34e894fa50f619a26cc7ffafc9784a4f25> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
