<urn:sha256:b2c2e8ac64ca781430d95ad522ccab34e894fa50f619a26cc7ffafc9784a4f25> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/FullWidthSyntheticIv> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b2c2e8ac64ca781430d95ad522ccab34e894fa50f619a26cc7ffafc9784a4f25> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:deterministic-aead-from-hmac> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b2c2e8ac64ca781430d95ad522ccab34e894fa50f619a26cc7ffafc9784a4f25> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The synthetic IV and tag is the full 32 bytes of HMAC-SHA-256" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b2fc630e2919d910d51fcab8ccdd883d05fb6c3bf2e9edef06e075a052591caa> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
