<urn:sha256:b2fc630e2919d910d51fcab8ccdd883d05fb6c3bf2e9edef06e075a052591caa> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:upstream-contribution-policy> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b2fc630e2919d910d51fcab8ccdd883d05fb6c3bf2e9edef06e075a052591caa> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Upstream defects go to Oxigraph's tracker one per issue, spec gaps to the W3C suites or the working group, and design findings to Oxigraph Discussions, each linked from a Varve issue" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b2fe973db00e5be52b0876d8059b75980d508ce9f42b78f71b13c6927a512cd7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
