<urn:sha256:b2fe973db00e5be52b0876d8059b75980d508ce9f42b78f71b13c6927a512cd7> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/BodyIsAllocThenAssertThenRetract> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b2fe973db00e5be52b0876d8059b75980d508ce9f42b78f71b13c6927a512cd7> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:format-version-1> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b2fe973db00e5be52b0876d8059b75980d508ce9f42b78f71b13c6927a512cd7> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A commit's body is chunks of alloc, then assert, then retract, each with its own count, with asserted and retracted quads sorted; the closing record's body ends with the commit header and its length" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b37e14ba580a3820c1dfe593b89ff8b9223df3cbd3e1c8fd4de19c5e3a8c232a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
