<urn:sha256:b37e14ba580a3820c1dfe593b89ff8b9223df3cbd3e1c8fd4de19c5e3a8c232a> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The values of xml:base, xml:lang and its:dir are copied out of the arena when met, because they outlive the top-level node element the arena is reset for; a scope attribute happens once per element and not once per triple" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b3adc2dce41d2d625429a01442fc7e1009f6c55bd04aa8285da4c02267651245> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
