<urn:sha256:b3adc2dce41d2d625429a01442fc7e1009f6c55bd04aa8285da4c02267651245> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The associated data is version, key id, term id, position and allocation index, each fixed-width, and removing a slot field reintroduces the equality oracle" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b40a62bbe02c476bf096b0da4fca64cbe19a19428b577ab2869f0bc40d96eddd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
