<urn:sha256:b40a62bbe02c476bf096b0da4fca64cbe19a19428b577ab2869f0bc40d96eddd> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "As-of reads are structurally stable for ever, and erasure changes only the readability of private terms, at every position at once" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b44e462dfe0546f0edb4dc35e59aba5ca95a8aeefc014b93325699935b2ad399> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
