<urn:sha256:b547b45bcb5a5fc3b8d6ecb45d0a05d95f9d954d5640a955121c5898ab14208d> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The approval is a pull request conversation comment containing approve and at least twelve characters of the current head, by a holder of Approve for every agent in the pull request; review submissions are not consulted" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b56be5110859138de4c48efa9df2d65395f6bbb7eec8d29a59a2eca85be51142> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
