<urn:sha256:b56be5110859138de4c48efa9df2d65395f6bbb7eec8d29a59a2eca85be51142> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "ProblemCatalogue fixes each problem type's title, status and extension members, the writer emits only from it, instance is the request id, and every non-2xx is application/problem+json with 401 deliberately thin" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:b5b95b6cc8c00107fbfd768f6f4e1b5aa8b99c45b55e215ed855b91dcad01fd6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
