<urn:sha256:b60fb252d9310e6c68f3413a0993a74fcceaf674fac5a2bac299b8c2b8a12e8e> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A read's pin or as-of view is taken when the endpoint starts and released when the response has finished, through RegisterForDisposeAsync" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
