<urn:sha256:b8faf6b60ab3b16d49f21022b4315907ac4c46422cf0337e5a595f310cba330b> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The on-behalf-of exchange is exercised only against Entra, in a workflow_dispatch run in a main-only environment, with the calling application signed in by a GitHub federated credential and the user by an interactive device-code sign-in, so no credential is stored; CI proves Varve's side with a minted token carrying oid and azp, and no exchange is simulated" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
