<urn:sha256:be85a73e757f2da302382da362033f788716acafef7ab01eef12a83d25393497> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/RefuseRatherThanGuess> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:be85a73e757f2da302382da362033f788716acafef7ab01eef12a83d25393497> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:header-chain-and-divergence> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:be85a73e757f2da302382da362033f788716acafef7ab01eef12a83d25393497> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A store refuses to open a log whose chain does not verify, and refuses to continue from a head that is not its own" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:be8f00972b74812f0256dd44391c5acba2910deb2df3b459609e531dd912a3aa> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:be8f00972b74812f0256dd44391c5acba2910deb2df3b459609e531dd912a3aa> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0112" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:be8f00972b74812f0256dd44391c5acba2910deb2df3b459609e531dd912a3aa> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/InstrumentationPerRequestNeverPerRow> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:be8f00972b74812f0256dd44391c5acba2910deb2df3b459609e531dd912a3aa> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:telemetry-in-two-layers> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:be8f00972b74812f0256dd44391c5acba2910deb2df3b459609e531dd912a3aa> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Every span is per request and every measurement per commit, per checkpoint or per maintenance step, never per quad or per solution and never on a callback that would hold the dataset; an instrumented request allocates nothing per solution beyond 7a's figure" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bec98f49689b3fa001731ccd8032e4528babf60c37425293d56c069e775ad8c8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bec98f49689b3fa001731ccd8032e4528babf60c37425293d56c069e775ad8c8> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:VARVE0003 findings on Varve.Store in session 3 of #43" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bec98f49689b3fa001731ccd8032e4528babf60c37425293d56c069e775ad8c8> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/TermLookupsAreHashLookups> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bec98f49689b3fa001731ccd8032e4528babf60c37425293d56c069e775ad8c8> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:store-hot-path-scope> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bec98f49689b3fa001731ccd8032e4528babf60c37425293d56c069e775ad8c8> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The store's per-term lookups, interning a term, resolving a request's term and staging one, are lookups in hash tables keyed by term under RdfTerm's comparer or by the ids of a triple term's parts, which hash and compare in place and allocate nothing; a term the table does not hold yet adds its entry and its allocation, once per term per request" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf792680ce1b020f02975481e69f72c616182096369d77ca72b8eaea15e948b3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf792680ce1b020f02975481e69f72c616182096369d77ca72b8eaea15e948b3> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0091" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf792680ce1b020f02975481e69f72c616182096369d77ca72b8eaea15e948b3> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/DatasetResolverSeam> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf792680ce1b020f02975481e69f72c616182096369d77ca72b8eaea15e948b3> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:varve-protocol-and-varve-server> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf792680ce1b020f02975481e69f72c616182096369d77ca72b8eaea15e948b3> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Varve.Protocol asks an IDatasetResolver the host implements for the dataset a request names" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf7a7074bb7a17b004b3ab507c9d7deba0cade54d767f8e4ff04c65a62349f7e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf7a7074bb7a17b004b3ab507c9d7deba0cade54d767f8e4ff04c65a62349f7e> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0025" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf7a7074bb7a17b004b3ab507c9d7deba0cade54d767f8e4ff04c65a62349f7e> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/GeneratorsReviewedAsTests> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf7a7074bb7a17b004b3ab507c9d7deba0cade54d767f8e4ff04c65a62349f7e> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:property-based-testing> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:bf7a7074bb7a17b004b3ab507c9d7deba0cade54d767f8e4ff04c65a62349f7e> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A generator is reviewed as carefully as its property, and term generators produce escapes, surrogate pairs, directional language tags, ucschar IRIs and nested triple terms" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c02b2a6d5c2e073e40c5585658cddb3a80c4298a28c41b1c8d485779578b72ef> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c02b2a6d5c2e073e40c5585658cddb3a80c4298a28c41b1c8d485779578b72ef> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0125" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c02b2a6d5c2e073e40c5585658cddb3a80c4298a28c41b1c8d485779578b72ef> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/ConflictEvidenceIsBounded> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c02b2a6d5c2e073e40c5585658cddb3a80c4298a28c41b1c8d485779578b72ef> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:per-graph-optimistic-concurrency> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c02b2a6d5c2e073e40c5585658cddb3a80c4298a28c41b1c8d485779578b72ef> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The commits that caused a conflict are listed outside the sequencer, newest first, limited in count and in log distance, saying when the list stopped short" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c064df6a00a47fde7fe21c85c86f23c164503374ee754f44ab3fd78581f63434> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c064df6a00a47fde7fe21c85c86f23c164503374ee754f44ab3fd78581f63434> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0065" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c064df6a00a47fde7fe21c85c86f23c164503374ee754f44ab3fd78581f63434> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/PositionIsAWrapper> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c064df6a00a47fde7fe21c85c86f23c164503374ee754f44ab3fd78581f63434> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:wrapper-types-and-the-store-log-namespace> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c064df6a00a47fde7fe21c85c86f23c164503374ee754f44ab3fd78581f63434> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Every log position is a Position over long, ordered as I1 requires, with no public arithmetic" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c08b60aa765b2781fea38fa48780d451a56c145afd0649c3bd07a9368ae3b736> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c08b60aa765b2781fea38fa48780d451a56c145afd0649c3bd07a9368ae3b736> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0086" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c08b60aa765b2781fea38fa48780d451a56c145afd0649c3bd07a9368ae3b736> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/ScriptLeavesWhenItsPortIsConsumed> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c08b60aa765b2781fea38fa48780d451a56c145afd0649c3bd07a9368ae3b736> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:home-of-the-eng-gates> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c08b60aa765b2781fea38fa48780d451a56c145afd0649c3bd07a9368ae3b736> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A script leaves eng/ when its port is released and Varve consumes it from there; one issue in each destination, with the provenance on Varve's side, is the exit criterion" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c12e4d4d1607c76ef19aca70dc5457d0acde42917a06eaaac72bc47ced44e820> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c12e4d4d1607c76ef19aca70dc5457d0acde42917a06eaaac72bc47ced44e820> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0094" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c12e4d4d1607c76ef19aca70dc5457d0acde42917a06eaaac72bc47ced44e820> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/WriteIsAtMostOneCommit> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c12e4d4d1607c76ef19aca70dc5457d0acde42917a06eaaac72bc47ced44e820> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:a-write-over-http-is-one-commit> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c12e4d4d1607c76ef19aca70dc5457d0acde42917a06eaaac72bc47ced44e820> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Every write request is at most one commit: an update through the executor with no retries, a Graph Store PUT or DELETE pinned and expecting the pin, a POST asserting its body" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c133349201f6b48f554e9a4ae74681d9d6f0cc9b2536d1f65c22ccbff178be0f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c133349201f6b48f554e9a4ae74681d9d6f0cc9b2536d1f65c22ccbff178be0f> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0014" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
