<urn:sha256:c133349201f6b48f554e9a4ae74681d9d6f0cc9b2536d1f65c22ccbff178be0f> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:header-chain-and-divergence> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c133349201f6b48f554e9a4ae74681d9d6f0cc9b2536d1f65c22ccbff178be0f> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The durable log format carries a version discriminator, so a change to what is hashed is a stated migration rather than a corruption" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c13497241588b52b89469952a6b0fd7361ccb2a4684593f43ce2ce08ec898bdc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
