<urn:sha256:c13497241588b52b89469952a6b0fd7361ccb2a4684593f43ce2ce08ec898bdc> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The refresh token is kept in one file under the user's profile, mode 0600 on Unix and refused when wider, DPAPI-protected on Windows through System.Security.Cryptography.ProtectedData, and weaker than the macOS Keychain, which the operator guide says" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c1407510066d046a3cccaeb2fb1ef12f5a9fcfda38cd588679f4eefcfadfec07> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
