<urn:sha256:c1407510066d046a3cccaeb2fb1ef12f5a9fcfda38cd588679f4eefcfadfec07> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "Subscribe(from, filter) delivers closed commits after from, in order and at-least-once, and the consumer owns its position" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c170c1cb13846cd4fece6775666e56f2772832a8cebd73cc8241a67bf1d1d349> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c170c1cb13846cd4fece6775666e56f2772832a8cebd73cc8241a67bf1d1d349> <urn:ledger:ns#basedOn> "adr:0079" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c170c1cb13846cd4fece6775666e56f2772832a8cebd73cc8241a67bf1d1d349> <urn:ledger:ns#ofDecision> <urn:dec:varve/DictionaryCachesAreBounded> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c170c1cb13846cd4fece6775666e56f2772832a8cebd73cc8241a67bf1d1d349> <urn:ledger:ns#set> <urn:ledger-set:the-term-dictionary-on-disk> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c170c1cb13846cd4fece6775666e56f2772832a8cebd73cc8241a67bf1d1d349> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "The dictionary keeps two caches of fixed size, term to id and id to term, one slot per hash; a lookup that misses and finds the term allocates the slot's entry, and nothing else on a lookup allocates" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c1f59dc5da43054283157f90eb2854abcf7e61d39e6ca5d8a7c9abbe7a2f0aae> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
