<urn:sha256:c1f59dc5da43054283157f90eb2854abcf7e61d39e6ca5d8a7c9abbe7a2f0aae> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "GET /datasets/{name}/status, the one admin endpoint of 7a, reports the dataset's id, head, durability, settings, checkpoints and failure" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c1f62b15284e14f47c23d9f7ead33e553f4bdb88748e444d5380b98f8e4a8d0d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
