<urn:sha256:c1f62b15284e14f47c23d9f7ead33e553f4bdb88748e444d5380b98f8e4a8d0d> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "An ADR's Status line names each of its amendments and each ADR superseding it, with dates" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
<urn:sha256:c274db0f6a51a15f5cce9ccd97edc73813caf330f48e94b4c1015fe95808fe4b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <urn:ledger:ns#DecisionVersion> <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
