<urn:sha256:e8c9978ecb5e28a12daac6e7d585bbac1cdbc1c27c59964ec3fa12ec941c5b7d> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "MessagePack, which Aspire.Hosting brings into Varve.Aspire's and the sample's closures, is pinned by central transitive pinning to 2.5.303, past GHSA-qhrr-8q5h-9q3h, scoped to src/Varve.Aspire/ and samples/, until Aspire.Hosting's own dependency moves past it; amended 2026-10-16" <urn:varve-spike:g/ledger> .
